Package: rjfiglet
Title: R Interface to Julia's FIGlet.jl for ASCII Art
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given="Guangchuang", family="Yu", email = "guangchuangyu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Guangchuang Yu <guangchuangyu@gmail.com>
Description: Provides an R interface to the Julia package FIGlet.jl for generating ASCII art text banners.
    This package uses juliaCall to call Julia functions from R, allowing R users to access figlet functionality.
